<===> README.md
In compressed mode, multi-line custom property values are folded onto a
single line like dart-sass (`_writeFoldedValue`): every line feed and the
whitespace following it become a single space. `single_line` is a
control. Expected output generated with dart-sass 1.93.1.
<===>
================================================================================
<===> blank_lines/options.yml
:output_style: compressed

<===> blank_lines/input.scss
.a {
  --b: {
    c: d;

    e: f;
  };
}
<===> blank_lines/output.css
.a{--b: { c: d; e: f; }}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> bracketed/options.yml
:output_style: compressed

<===> bracketed/input.scss
.a {
  --b: {
    c: d;
    e: f;
  }
}
<===> bracketed/output.css
.a{--b: { c: d; e: f; } }
<===>
================================================================================
<===> multi_line/options.yml
:output_style: compressed

<===> multi_line/input.scss
.a {
  --b: // (
    );
}
<===> multi_line/output.css
.a{--b: // ( )}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> single_line/options.yml
:output_style: compressed

<===> single_line/input.scss
.a {
  --b: value1 value2;
  --c:value;
}
<===> single_line/output.css
.a{--b: value1 value2;--c:value}
